        <mxCell id="c64" value="&lt;b&gt;git shared set &amp;lt;file&amp;gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dichiara shared un file tracciato: sezione in .gitshared (staging) e attesa in .git/config. &lt;b&gt;Al commit&lt;/b&gt;: prima versione v1 in refs/shared/&amp;lt;id&amp;gt;, branch attivi." style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#333333;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
